-- This function come from OverTheBox by OVH with many changes
-- Copyright 2015 OVH <OverTheBox@ovh.net>
-- Simon Lelievre (simon.lelievre@corp.ovh.com)
-- Sebastien Duponcheel <sebastien.duponcheel@ovh.net>
